  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">Electric - Arkansas, seeking state regulatory approval, which was denied 1/2/2015Electric - Louisiana, seeking state regulatory approval. The docket seeking this approval was closed by an Administrative Law Judge because the proceeding had been pending for more than one year.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
