  <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;AEP Transmission Company, LLC, controls 100% of the Respondent as of December 31, 2025. AEP Transmission Holding Company, LLC, controls 100% of AEP Transmission Company, LLC as of December 31, 2025. American Electric Power Company, Inc., a registered holding company, controls 100% of AEP Transmission Holding Company, LLC as of December 31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
